TI  - Pneumocystis pneumonia in combination with invasive pulmonary aspergillosis of a patient with Hodgkin's lymphoma
AU  - Idrisov A.A.
AU  - Shadrivova O.V.
AU  - Desyatik E.A.
AU  - Karyagin I.E.
AU  - Shneyder T.V.
