TI  - Thymic epithelial tumor-Associated Cytopenia: A 10-year observational study in France
AU  - Rivoisy, C.
AU  - Besse, B.
AU  - Girard, N.
AU  - Lioger, B.
AU  - Viallard, J.-F.
AU  - Lega, J.-C.
